# Order Processing Microservices V1

Event-driven backend system built with Java, Spring Boot, RabbitMQ, MySQL, and Docker Compose.

## Services

- order-service
- payment-service
- notification-service

## Features

- Create orders
- Publish OrderCreatedEvent
- Process payments with randomized SUCCESS or FAILED result
- Publish PaymentCompletedEvent
- Update order status to CONFIRMED or PAYMENT_FAILED
- Generate custom notifications based on payment result
- Separate MySQL database per service
- Shared RabbitMQ broker
- Docker Compose setup for local development

## Tech Stack

Java 21, Spring Boot, Spring Data JPA, MySQL, RabbitMQ, Docker Compose, Maven

## Run Locally

```bash
docker compose up --build